According to the given information,

A + B means ‘A is the daughter of B’;

A - B means ‘B is the brother of A’;

A × B means ‘B is the wife of A’;

A ÷ B means ‘A is the father of B’;

 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9c623f2bcbf6dbece95590a1da007bf17ca52edd28af0f1e253d17283c8d72ea.png] 

Given Expression - ‘P + Q × R – S ÷ T’

 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/bfb4342e4e663482eabad21a2c7f594ad3ba10a6f1375e7f44c98104d8708579.png] 

Hence, the correct answer is **"Option 1"**

**Given:**

(16 ÷ 8) × { 40 ÷ 2 + (11 ÷ 6) × (8 − 2) }

**Formula Used:**

Simplify brackets first

Multiply and divide from left to right

**Calculation:**

(16 ÷ 8) × { 40 ÷ 2 + (11 ÷ 6) × (8 − 2) }

⇒ (2) × { 20 + (11 ÷ 6) × (6) }

⇒ (2) × { 20 + 11 }

⇒ 2 × 31 = 62

**∴ The correct answer is 62.**
